{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16971","headline":"酬陆三与邹十八侍御 · 武元衡","name":"酬陆三与邹十八侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城分流水郭连山，拂露开怀一解颜。\n令尹关中仙史会，河阳县里玉人闲。\n共怜秋隼惊飞至，久想云鸿待侣还。\n莫恨殷勤留此地，东崖桂树昔同攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16971.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16971","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}